I might've done something wrong to you.

00:13:11.023 --> 00:13:12.388
Noi!

00:13:12.758 --> 00:13:16.128
Wh.. What is this?
I didn't come here for you guys!

00:13:16.128 --> 00:13:17.755
Come over here, and clean up for us!
Clean up!

00:13:18.297 --> 00:13:19.632
Clean up?

00:13:19.632 --> 00:13:21.133
Where's Sunako?

00:13:21.133 --> 00:13:22.468
Well, she's ...

00:13:22.468 --> 00:13:23.526
Look!

00:13:32.011 --> 00:13:34.113
Wh.. What happened to her?

00:13:34.113 --> 00:13:35.481
We don't know.

00:13:35.481 --> 00:13:38.517
When we told her it's already November,
she turned that way all of a sudden.

00:13:38.517 --> 00:13:41.520
And because of the situation we haven't
even been able to take a bath.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:45.958
Takenaga talked to you like he did
because he smells so bad.

00:13:45.958 --> 00:13:46.892
What?

00:13:46.892 --> 00:13:50.692
Come on, this is an opportunity to impress
Takenaga by cleaning this place up.

00:13:51.931 --> 00:13:53.831
I... I...

00:13:53.999 --> 00:13:55.334
I will do it!

00:13:55.334 --> 00:13:56.801
Yes, Noi!

00:13:56.969 --> 00:13:59.529
Come on, bring it on!

00:14:02.875 --> 00:14:06.003
Hello, Mom? How do you work
a washing machine?

00:14:07.479 --> 00:14:09.148
I'll do anything for Takenaga!

00:14:09.148 --> 00:14:10.983
For him, I'll go over mountains
and swim across the ocean!

00:14:10.983 --> 00:14:12.084
Man, I'm old school.

00:14:12.084 --> 00:14:14.314
Turn on the auto-wash switch!

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:17.456
Huh?

00:14:17.456 --> 00:14:18.946
I already pulled that gag.

00:14:19.258 --> 00:14:23.388
Dishes for four for every meal sure add up!

00:14:25.831 --> 00:14:26.957
CRASH

00:14:27.399 --> 00:14:29.094
Oh, no...

00:14:29.702 --> 00:14:31.567
She's at the same level as me.

00:14:35.574 --> 00:14:38.702
A big house is nice and all, but when it comes
to cleaning I'd think twice about it.

00:14:46.986 --> 00:14:49.054
The cleaning solution is burning my eyes!

00:14:49.054 --> 00:14:50.544
I know exactly what you're talking about!

00:14:52.858 --> 00:14:55.224
It takes a lot more energy to
clean than I thought.

00:14:56.395 --> 00:14:59.364
Why are you working so hard?

00:15:00.766 --> 00:15:01.834
Because...

00:15:01.834 --> 00:15:03.002
Because?

00:15:03.002 --> 00:15:08.963
Because if I work hard and help out,
Takenaga might like me more.

00:15:09.708 --> 00:15:11.377
I understand he had a reason to,

00:15:11.377 --> 00:15:13.946
but when he told me to stay away
from him this morning,

00:15:13.946 --> 00:15:16.815
I was so sad I could have died.

00:15:16.815 --> 00:15:21.548
So, the fear of being hated by Takenaga is
enough to make me work hard at anything!

00:15:22.688 --> 00:15:25.384
I'm sorry, it's my fault.

00:15:25.991 --> 00:15:27.326
Nah...

00:15:27.326 --> 00:15:31.456
I'm always envious of you, Sunako.

00:15:31.664 --> 00:15:32.965
Me?

00:15:32.965 --> 00:15:36.368
Because you get to be with
Takenaga all the time.

00:15:36.368 --> 00:15:39.438
I'm no different from any
other girl out there.

00:15:39.438 --> 00:15:43.375
I've admired him so much.
I've been in love with him.

00:15:43.375 --> 00:15:45.309
And I've wanted him to notice me.

00:15:47.012 --> 00:15:51.216
But it's not easy to impress someone, is it?

00:15:51.216 --> 00:15:53.452
On the other hand, I am impressed
with you, Sunako.

00:15:53.452 --> 00:15:56.121
You take care of everything every day,
all by yourself!

00:15:56.121 --> 00:15:58.954
I'm totally hopeless compared to you.

00:15:59.358 --> 00:16:00.960
I can't do anything right.

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:00.993
I can't do anything right.

00:16:00.993 --> 00:16:01.694
Burning!

00:16:01.694 --> 00:16:02.728
My eyes! My eyes!

00:16:02.728 --> 00:16:03.660
My eyes! My eyes!

00:16:06.465 --> 00:16:08.092
Are you okay?

00:16:10.869 --> 00:16:13.997
Here, you can have this, so cheer up!

00:16:15.107 --> 00:16:16.972
