00:16:27.286 --> 00:16:30.221
I need your help, guys!
We're going to have a party today!

00:16:30.889 --> 00:16:31.856
Party?

00:16:32.024 --> 00:16:34.326
A Halloween party!

00:16:34.326 --> 00:16:37.818
Sunako has been depressed because she
didn't get to celebrate Halloween!

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:41.100
October 31st... Halloween, huh?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.936
Now that I think about it, she was carrying
a pumpkin for a long time.

00:16:43.936 --> 00:16:45.404
A party, huh?

00:16:45.404 --> 00:16:50.275
See? We should hurry up and clean
everything up and have a Halloween party!

00:16:50.275 --> 00:16:52.402
Well, good luck!

00:16:52.911 --> 00:16:55.114
Hey, hey, hey, hey, wait a second!

00:16:55.114 --> 00:16:58.250
Sunako has to bust her butt and do all the
work around the house every day!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.719
Don't you want to show her some
appreciation at least?!

00:17:00.719 --> 00:17:03.586
Why are you supporting her so much?

00:17:03.789 --> 00:17:05.224
Because...

00:17:05.224 --> 00:17:07.283
I love Sunako so much!

00:17:10.062 --> 00:17:12.030
Well, that's that!

00:17:12.531 --> 00:17:14.199
You heard her.

00:17:14.199 --> 00:17:15.166
Okay...

00:17:16.068 --> 00:17:17.102
Guess we're gonna do this!

00:17:17.102 --> 00:17:18.203
Let's do it!

00:17:18.203 --> 00:17:19.500
Oh well...

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:32.912
